# Task index

Living inventory of work tasks. Newest items first within each section. Each task is a folder `YYMMDD-<task-description>/` with a `TASK.md`; link to that file. Do not copy task details here. `TEMPLATE.md` is not a task.

This file was added while adopting an existing workspace. Inventory existing `tasks/*/TASK.md` files into the sections below. Use `Unverified` until the status is known; then move the item into one of the four status sections.

